{"title":"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part B","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A pair of functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is called a <i>Payneful pair</i> if\n</p>\n<ol type=\"i\">\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is a real number for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />,</li>\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is a real number for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />,</li>\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/666ab54d9c1d0d6165b579674b99f9daf3bb1c03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x + y) = f(x)g(y) + g(x)f(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"252\" height=\"20\" /> for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />,</li>\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/a/38acbae6753997138cb9653eb5236a1ac4709446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x + y) = g(x)g(y) - f(x)f(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"251\" height=\"20\" /> for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />,</li>\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/3/50326cbe26e45991d3efed32f590718378529073.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a) \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"70\" height=\"20\" /> for some real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>For every Payneful pair of functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />:\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/6/686a47f65678ce4d157af5e586f3cc3795ab34c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(x) = (f(x))^{2} + (g(x))^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"196\" height=\"21\" /> for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/0/9605b5d18f25f22926e5a6ae53699f2ed2809cff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(5)h(-5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_B&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Like in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_A\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part A\">solution 2 of part a</a>, we can start by noticing that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/4/134ee381b2fedb6d1855bc257fa3ae08ffcda57d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\sin{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/2/53242cd1b5e3bc75ec786563ab07fe323403c405.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x) = \\cos{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"98\" height=\"20\" /> satisfies the requirements. This means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/7/1f745cf4286f88b236750e1e9a8abe3dacd9dc39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> could be:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/6/756d082704341d246e8839c126df3bd09987e4e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(x) = (\\sin{x})^{2} + (\\cos{x})^{2} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"233\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>From this, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/2/0d2c4d5e35fa25b691ba9ce2e6a043662e0ff38d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(5) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/9/e89f0c4e7b2081c506b5aa9df2c22cd2474071cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(-5) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/c/0ac9c601fcacddad64c0c9ae77ba140e14e44d1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(5)h(-5) = 1 \\times 1 = \\boxed{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"193\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018034308\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 106/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1416/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4690/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   17.202      1 -total\n 65.15%   11.208      1 2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3\n 31.44%    5.408      1 Template:Solution\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37418:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018034308 and revision id 289140. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}